 into English at different times", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:10:57Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Mast Q", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:10:58Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "and that is why the hospitality industry has hotels", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:11:06Z", "username": "Yash Badani", "text": "X was Hospitalis🫡 ‎", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:11:42Z", "username": "Yash Badani", "text": "Lodging was a nice clue there", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:15:03Z", "username": "Yash Badani", "text": "The Latin word X meant “to write.” It entered English through two different routes over time.\nOne form (Y) came earlier through Old French and refers to a person who writes books or documents.\nThe other form (Z) came later directly from Latin and refers to a brief written message.\nIdentify X, Y, Z.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:15:12Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Diary?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:15:33Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Scribe?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:15:33Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "scribe", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:15:40Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "script", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:15:57Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Scribble", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:15:57Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Scribus?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:16:06Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "scrivener?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:16:13Z", "username": "Yash Badani", "text": "X = scribere\nY = scribe\n Z = script", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-28T20:16:23Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Interesting. German mein \"to write\" still means \"screiben\" (pronounced as \"sch-raay-ben\") ‎", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]